{"1":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"أَعُوذُ","d":"aʿūdhu","e":"I seek refuge"},{"c":"بِرَبِّ","d":"birabbi","e":"in (the) Lord"},{"c":"الْفَلَقِ","d":"l-falaqi","e":"(of) the dawn"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"I seek refuge in the Lord of daybreak"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"From"},{"c":"شَرِّ","d":"sharri","e":"(the) evil"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(of) what"},{"c":"خَلَقَ","d":"khalaqa","e":"He created"}],"a":{"g":"From the evil of that which He created"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And from"},{"c":"شَرِّ","d":"sharri","e":"(the) evil"},{"c":"غَاسِقٍ","d":"ghāsiqin","e":"(of) darkness"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"وَقَبَ","d":"waqaba","e":"it settles"}],"a":{"g":"And from the evil of darkness when it settles"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And from"},{"c":"شَرِّ","d":"sharri","e":"(the) evil"},{"c":"النَّفَّاثَاتِ","d":"l-nafāthāti","e":"(of) the blowers"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْعُقَدِ","d":"l-ʿuqadi","e":"the knots"}],"a":{"g":"And from the evil of the blowers in knots"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And from"},{"c":"شَرِّ","d":"sharri","e":"(the) evil"},{"c":"حَاسِدٍ","d":"ḥāsidin","e":"(of) an envier"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"حَسَدَ","d":"ḥasada","e":"he envies"}],"a":{"g":"And from the evil of an envier when he envies.\""}}}